# Line-ending policy.
#
# This project is developed primarily on Windows and the editor writes CRLF, so
# text files are checked out CRLF. `text=auto` still normalizes them to LF inside
# the repository, which keeps diffs meaningful and stops the whole tree from
# showing as modified after a platform switch.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Shell scripts must stay LF or the shebang breaks when run on macOS/Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.wad binary
*.pk3 binary
*.zip binary
*.o binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.fon2 binary
*.md5mesh binary
*.md5anim binary
*.obj binary
*.icns binary
